# Chat build label footer

Before sending a **final** response to the user in this repo, read `Code/GameBuildLabel.cs` (constant `GameBuildLabel.Display`).

## Footer order (append at the very end, after the main answer)

1. **Build label** — one line:

`Build label — vX.Y.Z (Assistant)`

(use the actual `GameBuildLabel.Display` value; if the file is missing or unreadable: `Build label — (see GameBuildLabel.cs) (Assistant)`)

2. **What’s needed from you** (Commandment #2) — after a blank line, add a short section headed exactly **`What’s needed from you`** with bullets: prefab/scene edits, tests to run, settings to verify, or decisions only the user can make. If nothing applies, use a single bullet: **Nothing required on your side for this change.**

Keep the rest of the reply unchanged.
